 Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","review_id":"vXzwjNwQ0iZVQbQ9PIuruQ","date":"2014-09-07T09:22:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9324880242347717,"text_excerpt":"This location is the closest WH to the Quarter so I'm sure they get lots of rowdy customers. We were no exception. We were a little loud but it all seemed normal at this WH. What I really loved about this location was the security guard. I have never seen a security guard at a WH. Security at a dining establishment may raise an eyebrow for some folks but I took it all in stride. The security guard was so funny and personable. She talked to us for quite a bit while we were there and she really made our experience all the better. Our server was sweet and always had a smile on her face. We enjoyed her service. The food was quite delicious as usual. Can't go wrong with the food at Waffle House!"},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","review_id":"T3i9TebL_yvBhAxncYtOxg","date":"2015-12-27T16:44:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9174684286117554,"text_excerpt":"So we got a cab and went to WH. The food was the same as I remember, really bad and that makes it super yummy. Our waiter was good, the cooks were fast and I can't wait to go back. I wish we had a WH in Southern California!"},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","review_id":"IZdZTIjq6vLfU_l-R6Sk0Q","date":"2014-09-09T02:14:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9167047739028931,"text_excerpt":"Another WH for me to review and honestly I thought it was great but I'm a good ol boy from back in the thickets of north LA so a WH is like Commander's Palace to me & folks I'm a connoisseur! Now this night/morning Steve I. was driving and I couldn't get here again if I tried but he found it and we owned it.... Service with a smile even for 5 semi- drunk rowdys....Per usual I didn't need the menu and just ordered the usual (3 eggs scrambled, hash browns scattered, smothered, covered, chunked, capped & Country'd with a side of sausage)... plus a black coffee.... it was delivered to me muy perfecto! Talk about chowing down.... other than the outstanding vittles I vaguely remember being poss..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","photo_id":"GYsEQCLP2FMocF_Em0QEpA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GYsEQCLP2FMocF_Em0QEpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9131724834442139},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","photo_id":"Di7mmWmrwSuZT6yt1Xx3Sg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Di7mmWmrwSuZT6yt1Xx3Sg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8942646980285645},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","photo_id":"yiM6r9r9jYyXgsnUnVbSYw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yiM6r9r9jYyXgsnUnVbSYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8640643358230591},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","photo_id":"f23QP0betlCxV6G32GZoIQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/f23QP0betlCxV6G32GZoIQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7838252782821655},{"business_id":"LM-GRIDsDrH9jx6-rYXIoQ","photo_id":"EySr-JCYpDdeCEPpiIvHng","label":"food","imag